---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
import Stage from "../../components/Stage.astro";
import Code from "../../components/Code.astro";
---
<Base title="Button: variants, sizes and states" description="iVOLT button: primary, secondary, ghost and danger variants, sizes, icon-only, disabled and loading states, and button groups. CSS only.">
  <article class="docs-prose">
    <h1>Button</h1>
    <p>Use a <code>&lt;button&gt;</code> for actions and an <code>&lt;a&gt;</code> for navigation; both take the same classes. No JavaScript is involved.</p>
    <p class="docs-meta"><strong>CSS:</strong> included in <code>ivolt.css</code>; standalone <code>css/components/button.css</code> (needs <code>core.css</code>).</p>

    <Stage primary name="button/variants" title="Every variant of the button" />

    <Section title="Variants" num={1}>
      <p>Without a variant the button is neutral. <code>--primary</code> is for the main action of a view, <code>--secondary</code> outlines, <code>--ghost</code> is text-only, <code>--danger</code> marks destructive actions.</p>
    </Section>

    <Section title="Sizes and icon-only" num={2}>
      <p>Default height is 2.5rem; <code>--sm</code> is 2rem and <code>--lg</code> 3rem. Icon-only buttons need <code>aria-label</code> and keep a square target of at least 24×24 px.</p>
      <Stage name="button/sizes" title="Sizes and icon-only" />
    </Section>

    <Section title="States" num={3}>
      <p>Use the native <code>disabled</code> attribute on buttons and <code>aria-disabled="true"</code> on links. <code>aria-busy="true"</code> shows a spinner, blocks pointer events and keeps the label. Hover styles only apply on devices with hover; the focus ring uses <code>--iv-color-focus</code> on <code>:focus-visible</code>.</p>
      <Stage name="button/states" title="Disabled, busy and focus" />
    </Section>

    <Section title="Groups" num={4}>
      <Stage name="button/group" title="Buttons joined in a group" />
    </Section>

    <Section title="Customising" num={5}>
      <Code label="button.css" panels={[{ key: "css", label: "CSS", code: `.iv-button { --iv-button-radius: var(--iv-radius-full); }
.iv-button--primary { --iv-button-bg: var(--iv-color-accent); --iv-button-fg: var(--iv-color-on-accent); }` }]} />
      <p>Local properties: <code>--iv-button-bg</code>, <code>--iv-button-fg</code>, <code>--iv-button-border</code>, <code>--iv-button-radius</code>.</p>
    </Section>

    <Section title="Common mistakes" num={6}>
      <ul>
        <li>A <code>&lt;div&gt;</code> with the button class: not focusable, no keyboard activation.</li>
        <li>Icon-only button without <code>aria-label</code>.</li>
        <li>Several <code>--primary</code> buttons in one view; keep one main action.</li>
      </ul>
    </Section>
  </article>
</Base>
